      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bcbaf75fab2337b72ced6b0|full_name}: As of the latest update, I cannot actually join any worlds without getting stuck in a login loop: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/reconnecting-loop-based-on-ping\n\nYou only need to look as far as how quickly IK changes in the last few updates were reverted to see how much of an unmitigated disaster these updates have been.\n\nFurther issues will possibly only be resolved after the holidays -- Ron at the very least has expressed publicly on the official Discord server that playlists will not be fixed until New Year. This is why you don't release updates before the weekend or a holiday.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
